|---|---|---|
| `@vscode/codicons` | CC-BY-4.0 | Credit the author and indicate changes. Icons by Microsoft, from the VS Code Codicons project. |
| `caniuse-lite` | CC-BY-4.0 | Credit the Can I Use database and its contributors. |

